{
  "repo": 1,
  "name": "chunked-upload-kit",
  "what": "Chunked/resumable file upload — zero-dep server store + fastify/express adapters + browser/Node client. Gets large files past proxies that cap request bodies (e.g. Cloudflare 100MB).",
  "kind": "kit",
  "work": {
    "guide": "README.md",
    "test": "npm test"
  },
  "offers": [
    {
      "id": "chunk_store",
      "what": "與框架無關的分片上傳核心：createChunkStore({ dir, maxFileSize, maxChunkSize }) 回傳 { init, status, putChunk, complete, abort, sweep, startSweeper }，session 存在磁碟、重啟不掉。不用 fastify/express（Koa/Hono/原生 http）時直接用它；maxChunkSize 一定要小於前面 proxy 的 body 上限。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const { createChunkStore, ChunkError, sanitizeFilename } = require('chunked-upload-kit')"
    },
    {
      "id": "fastify_adapter",
      "what": "在 fastify 上掛好 init / chunk / status / complete / abort 五條路由：registerChunkedUpload(app, { prefix, store, auth, onInit, onComplete })。大檔上傳要穿過 Cloudflare 100MB 這類 body 上限時用；onComplete 的結果要 return，不要自己 reply.send()。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const { registerChunkedUpload, chunkedUploadPlugin } = require('chunked-upload-kit/fastify')"
    },
    {
      "id": "express_adapter",
      "what": "express / 原生 http 用的同一套分片上傳路由：app.use(prefix, chunkedUploadHandler({ store, auth, onComplete }))。不需要 express.json()，handler 自己解析 /init 的 body 並直接串流分片。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const { chunkedUploadHandler } = require('chunked-upload-kit/express')"
    },
    {
      "id": "upload_client",
      "what": "瀏覽器與 Node 共用的 ESM 上傳端：uploadChunked(file, { endpoint, headers, meta, completeBody, onProgress }) 切片平行送、逐片重試，回傳伺服器 onComplete 的結果。失敗時 UploadError.resumable 為真就留著 uploadId 再呼叫一次續傳，只補缺的分片；abortUpload 可取消。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "import { uploadChunked, UploadError, abortUpload } from 'chunked-upload-kit/client'"
    },
    {
      "id": "lan_probe",
      "what": "在家高速上傳：服務架在家裡經 tunnel 對外時，在家上傳改走家裡網路（實測快約 9 倍）。uploadChunked 加 lan: true 即可；自己寫的上傳用 LanProbe.probeLan(LanProbe.lanBaseFor(location.hostname)) 拿到 LAN 網址或 null。伺服器那半是 CloudPipe lan-gateway。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "import { probeLan, lanBaseFor } from 'chunked-upload-kit/client'  // 或 <script src=\"client/lan-probe.js\"> → window.LanProbe"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill",
      "what": "這個 kit 的打法。要上傳大檔（影片、壓縮包、超過 50MB）到自家服務，或上傳卡在個位數 %、Cloudflare 回 413 時先讀，不要再寫單一 multipart POST。",
      "how": "skill",
      "skill": "chunked-upload-kit"
    }
  ]
}
